    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e4ea7734acf337226111a00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓台球，就是欲擒故纵。\n让对方随便打，自己打入最后一球。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e00e1c28872ab143c6e5704fff01a1305bc6d55ae89262495ed674888c38c3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
