    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8159a29e0f4b40973f5bfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不可一世的台球高手天狼星象征。\n目白善信从这一位派对玩咖神（？）身上，\n学到了各种推杆的技巧了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff2e0b9c100a97d24f61b6927fdedea808c31216ba49d1f13ba54cde30efe3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
